			],
			"Message": "feat(Sky): Implement vscode.diff round-trip channel for SCM\n\nAdd the `sky://editor/diff` channel handler to bridge Mountain's `$scm:openDiff` events with the VS Code workbench. This enables the editor to render diffs when users click staged or unstaged files in the Source Control Management sidebar.\n\nThe implementation parses the positional arguments `[leftUri, rightUri, title?, options?]` serialised by Mountain. It invokes `vscode.diff` in the Wind workbench service layer with the appropriate `viewColumn` and `preview` flags. Crucially, it resolves the UI request promise upon completion to prevent the `vscode.git` extension from hanging on awaited promises for 300 seconds.\n\nThis completes the round-trip IPC contract for the diff operation, ensuring seamless integration between the SCM UI and the extension host.",
			"SHA": "615baba012d83f77853ed189aaa83120c4bed308"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Auto",
			"Date": "2026-05-18T02:54:57Z",
