				"⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				142,
				6
			],
			"Message": "feat(Sky): Rebrand application identity to FIDDEE\n\nUpdate all application metadata and telemetry identifiers to reflect the new \"FIDDEE\" branding across the Sky component layer. Modify `Public/Manifest.json` and `Public/product.json` to replace \"Land\" with \"FIDDEE\" in display names, bundle identifiers, data folder names, and URL protocols. Align `Source/Workbench/Electron/OTELBridge.ts` and `Source/Workbench/Electron/Post/Hog/Bridge.ts` to use \"fiddee\" for service names and PostHog `$app` keys. Update `astro.config.ts` to emit FIDDEE-specific build events and distinct IDs. Correct minor whitespace inconsistency in `README.md` headers.\n\nThis ensures the editor runtime, telemetry streams, and browser manifest consistently identify the application as FIDDEE rather than the legacy Land branding.",
			"SHA": "d175e932ae25fe38888ab9c080dca9a3340a5b09"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-17T15:36:07Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				142,
				2
			],
			"Message": "chore(Sky): Update branding URLs to PlayForm.Cloud instance\n\nMigrate all project references from the legacy `editor.land` and `Editor.Land` domains to the temporary hosting provider `land.playform.cloud`. Update `Public/product.json` to point the documentation URL to the new instance. Revise `README.md` to reflect the new base URL for the logo, project title, documentation links, architecture resources, and maintainer contact email.\n\nThis ensures all public-facing links, badges, and metadata correctly route to the current deployment environment for the Sky component documentation and assets.",
			"SHA": "212a61e8a843137e2511aed120ae747d3e876747"
		},
